    "detailed_description": "What is possible between the dimensions of Hell and Heaven? Nothing? Or is there something after all?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe main character finds himself in a dark abyss where darkness and light merge, creating a world of mysteries and dangers. In this intermediate dimension, he encounters demons, angels, and creatures that belong to neither world. Every decision the hero makes affects his fate and opens new paths: he can slide deeper into the abyss or rise closer to the light.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers will explore mysterious locations, solve complex puzzles, and fight powerful enemies. As they progress, they will learn more about the hero's past and how he ended up in this place. Every action has consequences, and the ending depends on the chosen path.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain features:<br />\r\n- A deep and captivating storyline filled with mysticism and unexpected twists.<br />\r\n- Atmospheric locations, ranging from dark dungeons to bright heavenly palaces.<br />\r\n- A variety of enemies, including demons, angels, and neutral creatures.<br />\r\n- A choice system where every decision affects the course of the game and the final result.<br />\r\n- Puzzles and tasks that require not only strength, but also intelligence to solve.<br />\r\n- Embark on a journey between worlds and discover what lies in the abyss between Hell and Heaven.",
